Content that was removed rather than attributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The 2011-2014 version of this program shipped icons taken from the Eclipse
Platform debug user interface and from at least one other icon set whose origin
could not be established. Writing a NOTICE for them would have meant guessing,
so every icon the program ships is now generated by tools/generate_icons.py and
carries this project's own licence.

